        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;sequenceDiagram\n    autonumber\n    participant U as Usuario\n    participant R53 as Route 53\n    participant CF as CloudFront\n    participant API as API Gateway\n    participant CO as Checkout\n    participant INV as Inventario\n    participant DB as Orders DB\n    participant Q as SQS FIFO\n    participant PW as Payment Worker\n    participant ST as Stripe\n    participant OB as Outbox\n    participant SNS as SNS\n    participant IW as Ticket Issue\n    participant S3 as S3 Boletos\n    participant RC as Reconciliador\n\n    U-&gt;&gt;R53: GET /events\n    R53-&gt;&gt;CF: enruta a region mas cercana\n    CF--&gt;&gt;U: catalogo cacheado\n    U-&gt;&gt;API: POST /checkout {eventId, seatId}\n    API-&gt;&gt;CO: forward\n    CO-&gt;&gt;DB: INSERT order (PENDING)\n    CO-&gt;&gt;INV: RESERVE(seatId, orderId, TTL=10min)\n    INV-&gt;&gt;INV: UPDATE seats WHERE status=AVAILABLE\n    alt Reserva OK\n        INV--&gt;&gt;CO: 200 OK\n        CO--&gt;&gt;U: orderId + redirect a Stripe\n        U-&gt;&gt;ST: pago con tarjeta\n        ST--&gt;&gt;API: webhook payment_intent.succeeded\n        API-&gt;&gt;PW: procesar webhook\n        PW-&gt;&gt;PW: verificar idempotencia\n        PW-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE order SET status=PAID\n        PW-&gt;&gt;OB: INSERT evento order.paid\n        OB-&gt;&gt;SNS: publica order.paid\n        SNS-&gt;&gt;IW: consume\n        IW-&gt;&gt;S3: genera boleto PDF + QR\n        IW-&gt;&gt;DB: UPDATE order SET status=TICKET_ISSUED\n        IW--&gt;&gt;U: email con boleto\n    else Asiento tomado\n        INV--&gt;&gt;CO: 409 Conflict\n        CO--&gt;&gt;U: \&quot;asiento no disponible\&quot;\n    end\n    Note over RC,DB: Cada minuto revisa inconsistencias y corrige. Si PAID sin boleto mas de 2 min, reintenta. Si mas de 10 min, reembolsa. Reservas vencidas se liberan.\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="tcksN7WMk81wTsGH7a0S-70">
          <mxCell connectable="0" parent="1" style="group;transparentBounds=1;editIcon=1;lockedGroup=0;groupPadding=10;" vertex="1">
            <mxGeometry as="geometry" />
          </mxCell>
        </UserObject>
